  displayName: Gremlin
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 229d30d8ed952be40a5ece0f55378e9a, type: 3}
  description: "Gremlins are small fae pests, wiry and ugly, often seen as a blur
    scrambling over furniture and rafters. They move fast, darting in short, chaotic
    bursts. They don\u2019t speak; they make animalistic noises - clicks, chittering,
    and sharp yelps - like a furious animal that learned to hate everything around
    it."
